  "title": "Qt: Fix AltGr detection on Windows",
  "description": "Enabling the AltGr key detection in Qt by setting the `QT_QPA_PLATFORM`\nenvironment variable to `windows:altgr` (on Windows only).\n\nThis enables the Qt Windows platform plugin which properly detects\nAltGr key presses which would otherwise map to Ctrl+Alt and prevent\nspecial characters requiring AltGr on international keyboard layouts\nfrom being entered into text fields and trigger Ctrl+Alt shortcuts\ninstead.\n\nThis setting can still be overridden by specifying the `-platform`\ncommand line parameter.\n\nFixes #21382",
