      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 3524166200,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Yes, it fixes it. My idea was to set it as default if it is not set, which might be OK for 99,9% of all users. If someone chooses to set his own environment variable or to set the command line option, it's his responsibility (or even his intend) to set the correct values.\n\nI think altering the string of any already existing env var or arg value is not intended.",
